      "widgets_values": [
        "Instrumental ambient piano, gentle felt piano melody, soft bamboo flute accents, warm airy pads, a quiet bamboo forest at dawn, spacious and peaceful, 80 BPM, D major, 4/4, no vocals, no drums, a gentle ending.",
        "[Instrumental]",
